A(f)ve,(ii) A(i)ve,(hh) A(h)ve(g) Ma(g)ri(g)a.(j.) (;) A(h)ve,(ii) A(i)ve,(hh) A(h)ve(g) Ma(g)ri(HG)a.(f.) (::)

